This file is a placeholder example, not a live recall source.

Copy it to config/recall-source (or point KARAKOS_RECALL_SOURCE at a copy
elsewhere) and edit it directly to give every UserPromptSubmit turn a
static block of standing facts — see docs/EXTENDING.md, "Recall
re-injection", for the full interface (a plain file is read verbatim; an
executable file instead receives the pending prompt on stdin and its
stdout becomes the recall block).

config/recall-source does not exist by default, and inject-recall.py
treats that as a no-op — this example ships inert until an operator acts
on it.
